@@ -9213,3 +9213,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE F4 (capstone .397, UNGATED) -- the verifier scorecard. Headline questions: (1) did the oracle-distinct selection moat CLOSE the cross-GENERATOR axis on a NON-degenerate ARC-GEN pool (the LAST open axis)? (2) was the missing partial-state diffusion scorer built LEAK-FREE, and if so did the EXTERNAL verifier IMPROVE generation (beat RFG)? (3) did the efficiency Pareto win HARDEN against a well-prompted judge? Aggregate: CROSS-GENERATOR = exp4291 cross_generator_holds + cross_generator_delta + vote_at_1 + oracle_at_k + per_substrate_delta; PARTIAL-STATE = exp4292 partial_state_scorer_built + partial_state_leak_free + partial_state_auroc; IN-GENERATION = exp4293 diffusiongemma_guidance_moat + carnot_minus_rfg_delta (if it ran); EFFICIENCY = exp4294 efficiency_pareto_holds + cost_ratio; SELF-LEARNING = exp4295 online_adaptation_helps (tier-2 fixed); ARC = exp4296 total_levels (>=22?); hygiene = exp4299 regression_guard_passed. Emit cross_generator_moat_closes + in_generation_moat_holds + efficiency_pareto_hardened + verifier_thesis_state (one honest string). SKIP any flagged_adversarial artifact; HONOR verifier_is_oracle (a circular/execution-grounded win is NOT a moat). Compute the G1-G4 publication gate via publication_gate.py. NO gated_on. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_v397_artifacts_missing; results/experiment_4301_capstone_v397.json
 - 2026-06-16: Archive .397 -> activate .398; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the TRUE .397 close-state truthfully (NOT the spurious exp4301 all-False): CROSS-GENERATOR axis CLOSED (exp4291 cross_generator_delta +0.50, CI95 [0.29,0.71], vote@1=0.25, oracle@K=0.75, non-degenerate guards pass, verifier_is_oracle=false -- the LAST open axis of the selection moat); PARTIAL-STATE scorer BUILT leak-free (exp4292 AUROC 0.966, leak_ablation 0.937 -- a yellow flag warranting an independent re-check); IN-GENERATION moat NOT held (exp4293 FLAGGED tautology -- rfg=unguided=entrgi=0.3 no-op controls, quarantined); EFFICIENCY UNRESOLVED (exp4294 failed 3x on the 2h cap, no artifact -- a failed task, NOT a measured null; the .396 win stands un-hardened); SELF-LEARNING online-helps (exp4295 online 0.483 > static 0.417, tier-2 fixed); ARC 22 (exp4296 r11l L1); capstone+hygiene BLOCKED spuriously (exp4301/exp4299 -- one missing artifact hard-blocked the aggregation); paper_ready=True (FoVer 0.9131, G1-G4 as last computed .395). Frame .398 as prove-efficiency-parity + establish-in-generation-with-differentiated-controls + broaden-to-cross-domain. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v397_v398_active_cross_generator_closed_True_in_generation_degenerate_True_efficiency_unresolved_True_arc22_pretest_green; results/experiment_4302_archive_v397_activate_v398.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE A1 (THE HEADLINE; §5 win condition; re-scope the failed C1) -- PROVE EFFICIENCY-PARITY: energy-verifier vs a WELL-PROMPTED LLM-judge on cross-family ARC selection, reported as an iso-FLOPs accuracy curve. .396 (exp4284) showed the energy verifier BEATS a Qwen3.6-35B judge (0.654 vs 0.212) at ~50M× lower cost -- BUT the judge scored BELOW random (0.25 for 4 candidates), so a skeptic blames the prompt. .397's harden (exp4294) FAILED to run (doomed-looped on the 2h cap + a strong_judge.py bug; no artifact -- a failed task, NOT a measured null). RE-SCOPE to fit the window AND remove the weak-prompt confound: (a) a STRONGER judge prompt (few-shot + explicit grid-reasoning + CoT, per Thinking-Small-Judges arXiv:2509.13332) + a 2nd judge model (gemma-4-31B alongside Qwen3.6-35B); (b) report the head-to-head as a FIXED-COMPUTE / iso-FLOPs accuracy curve (Budget-aware Discriminative Verification arXiv:2510.14913) -- a discriminative verifier (one forward pass) vs a CoT judge is a clean iso-compute comparison; (c) FIT THE WINDOW: single-synchronous-resume-accumulate, checkpoint after EVERY judge call, per-task progress prints (the codex idle-timeout fix), a PARTIAL (one well-prompted judge, n>=30) ACCEPTED -- headroom-route, do NOT gate-block. Emit efficiency_pareto_holds BARE bool := (energy accuracy within/above the BEST-prompted judge's CI AND cost_ratio <= 0.1). verifier_is_oracle=false. Precedent: CompassVerifier 2508.03686, Calibrated Reasoning 2509.19681. This is the operator's STATED §5 win condition, finally hardened. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: hardened_pareto_win_delta_0.3000; results/experiment_4303_verifier_efficiency_parity_isoflops.json
+- 2026-06-16: PHASE B1 (the §5 in-generation headline; fix the .397 degenerate controls) -- DiffusionGemma energy-guided full run reusing the exp4292 partial-state scorer, with GENUINELY-ENGAGED controls + an independent leak re-check. .397 (exp4293) reported diffusiongemma_guidance_moat=true BUT was FLAGGED TAUTOLOGY: condition_accuracy {{carnot 0.867, rfg 0.3, unguided 0.3, entrgi 0.3}} -- three distinct controls bit-identical = the no-op signature, so 'Carnot beats RFG' was 'Carnot beats a no-op' (quarantined). The precise fix (2026-06-16 sweep): RFG (arXiv:2509.25604) is the log-likelihood ratio of an ENHANCED dLLM over a REFERENCE dLLM and no-ops to ==unguided ONLY when enhanced==reference -- so the .397 RFG arm had no distinct reference. FIX: (1) an INDEPENDENT leak re-check on the exp4292 scorer (AUROC 0.966 is a yellow flag for masked-state scoring -- if it FAILS the re-check, emit scorer_leaky_rebuild_needed and the in-generation moat stays OPEN with a named blocker); (2) >=1 GENUINELY-ENGAGED non-Carnot control -- RFG with a strictly-weaker reference (base/un-post-trained/lower-temp DiffusionGemma) vs the enhanced generator at gamma>0 (pick gamma in the provably-engaged regime, arXiv:2506.10971) OR EntRGi single-model entropy-gated guidance (arXiv:2602.05000, engages WITHOUT a 2nd checkpoint) -- PLUS a mechanical no-op guard that REJECTS the run if any two arms (unguided/rfg/entrgi) tie bit-identically; (3) only THEN the moat test. On a REASONING corpus (FoVer-step/math), n>=30 per arm. Emit diffusiongemma_guidance_moat BARE bool := (Carnot - best-engaged-control > 0 AND CI95-excl-0 AND controls_differentiated). verifier_is_oracle=false. NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=partial: diffusiongemma_guidance_prior_eval_incomplete; results/experiment_4304_diffusiongemma_in_generation_engaged_controls.json
